meta {
  name: Create product
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/products
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "Oat milk",
    "brand": "Oats Co",
    "barcode": "4006381333931",
    "nutritionBasis": "ml",
    "calories": 46.5,
    "protein": 1.1,
    "carbohydrates": 6.7,
    "fat": 1.5
  }
}

docs {
  Create a private product. Barcode is optional. Nutrition values are per 100 g or 100 ml according to nutritionBasis. GTIN values are validated and stored in canonical 14-digit form.

  A duplicate barcode in the same user's catalog returns 409. Invalid input returns 400; unauthenticated requests return 401.
}
